# Phase 2a rubric test fixtures. Generated, not authored.
#
# scripts/make-rubric-fixtures.mjs rebuilds every one of these in a second, and
# it reads the size cap out of lib/types.ts so the boundary fixtures cannot
# disagree with the guard they test. Two of them are about 500 KB of padding and
# pseudo-random noise, which is a megabyte of unreviewable binary in every clone
# forever, and a diff of a .xlsx tells a reviewer nothing anyway.
#
# The GENERATOR is the artifact worth keeping: it says in words what makes each
# file broken. Run it before the parser proof:
#     node scripts/make-rubric-fixtures.mjs
test-fixtures/

# Playwright MCP scratch output (page snapshots, console logs) from test runs.
.playwright-mcp/
